{
  "id": "1401",
  "title": "What Do Dogs Eat?",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2022-07-04",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming and his mom are talking about what puppies eat.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1401/10611dcfccb159f9906e2abb4fc678690d93da35.mp3?1632391826",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "狗吃什么\n\n小明：妈妈你看那儿！那小狗多好看！\n妈妈：是的，小狗很好看。\n小明：妈妈给我一点钱好吗？我想买点东西。\n妈妈：你想买什么？\n小明：小狗吃苹果，我想买些苹果。\n妈妈：好的，那你多买一些苹果。\n小明：小狗吃西瓜，我想买些西瓜。\n妈妈：好的，那你多买一些西瓜。\n小明：我想再买些雪糕。\n妈妈：什么？狗吃雪糕吗？\n小明：狗不吃雪糕，我吃。",
    "traditional": "狗吃什麼\n\n小明：媽媽你看那兒！那小狗多好看！\n媽媽：是的，小狗很好看。\n小明：媽媽給我一點錢好嗎？我想買點東西。\n媽媽：你想買什麼？\n小明：小狗吃蘋果，我想買些蘋果。\n媽媽：好的，那你多買一些蘋果。\n小明：小狗吃西瓜，我想買些西瓜。\n媽媽：好的，那你多買一些西瓜。\n小明：我想再買些雪糕。\n媽媽：什麼？狗吃雪糕嗎？\n小明：狗不吃雪糕，我吃。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What Do Dogs Eat?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明：妈妈你看那儿！那小狗多好看！",
      "traditional": "小明：媽媽你看那兒！那小狗多好看！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng mā ma nǐ kàn nà'r nà xiǎo gǒu duō hǎo kàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Mom, look over there! That puppy is so beautiful!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "妈妈：是的，小狗很好看。",
      "traditional": "媽媽：是的，小狗很好看。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma shì de xiǎo gǒu hěn hǎo kàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: Yes, the puppy is very beautiful."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小明：妈妈给我一点钱好吗？我想买点东西。",
      "traditional": "小明：媽媽給我一點錢好嗎？我想買點東西。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng mā ma gěi wǒ yì diǎn qián hǎo ma wǒ xiǎng mǎi diǎn dōng xi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Mom, can you give me some money? I want to buy a few things."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "妈妈：你想买什么？",
      "traditional": "媽媽：你想買什麼？",
      "pinyin": "mā ma nǐ xiǎng mǎi shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: What do you want to buy?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小明：小狗吃苹果，我想买些苹果。",
      "traditional": "小明：小狗吃蘋果，我想買些蘋果。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng xiǎo gǒu chī píng guǒ wǒ xiǎng mǎi xiē píng guǒ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Puppies eat apples. I want to buy some apples."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "妈妈：好的，那你多买一些苹果。",
      "traditional": "媽媽：好的，那你多買一些蘋果。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma hǎo de nà nǐ duō mǎi yì xiē píng guǒ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: Okay, then buy some more apples."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小明：小狗吃西瓜，我想买些西瓜。",
      "traditional": "小明：小狗吃西瓜，我想買些西瓜。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng xiǎo gǒu chī xī guā wǒ xiǎng mǎi xiē xī guā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Puppies eat watermelon. I want to buy some watermelon."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "妈妈：好的，那你多买一些西瓜。",
      "traditional": "媽媽：好的，那你多買一些西瓜。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma hǎo de nà nǐ duō mǎi yì xiē xī guā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: Ok, then buy some more watermelon."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "小明：我想再买些雪糕。",
      "traditional": "小明：我想再買些雪糕。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng wǒ xiǎng zài mǎi xiē xuě gāo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: I also want to buy some ice cream."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "妈妈：什么？狗吃雪糕吗？",
      "traditional": "媽媽：什麼？狗吃雪糕嗎？",
      "pinyin": "mā ma shén me gǒu chī xuě gāo ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: What? Do dogs eat ice cream?"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "小明：狗不吃雪糕，我吃。",
      "traditional": "小明：狗不吃雪糕，我吃。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng gǒu bù chī xuě gāo wǒ chī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Dogs don’t eat ice cream; I eat ice cream."
    }
  ],
