    "sentence_translations": [
      "What Do Dogs Eat?",
      "",
      "Little Ming: Mom, look over there! That puppy is so beautiful!",
      "",
      "Mom: Yes, the puppy is very beautiful.",
      "",
      "Little Ming: Mom, can you give me some money? I want to buy a few things.",
      "",
      "Mom: What do you want to buy?",
      "",
      "Little Ming: Puppies eat apples. I want to buy some apples.",
      "",
      "Mom: Okay, then buy some more apples.",
      "",
      "Little Ming: Puppies eat watermelon. I want to buy some watermelon.",
      "",
      "Mom: Ok, then buy some more watermelon.",
      "",
      "Little Ming: I also want to buy some ice cream.",
      "",
      "Mom: What? Do dogs eat ice cream?",
      "",
      "Little Ming: Dogs don’t eat ice cream; I eat ice cream.",
      ""
